  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.84,
      "end_seconds": 4.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "hello, good to see you please sit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.17,
      "end_seconds": 8.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "evening, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.99,
      "end_seconds": 10.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Cold out there today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.84,
      "end_seconds": 16.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Freezing, I could hardly feel my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.1,
      "end_seconds": 20.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "how are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.77,
      "end_seconds": 27.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Um, so... headaches in the morning. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.33,
      "end_seconds": 32.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.79,
      "end_seconds": 38.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Simvastatin. I take it 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.59,
      "end_seconds": 43.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.02,
      "end_seconds": 46.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "For three weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.72,
      "end_seconds": 50.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "anything that improves it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.31,
      "end_seconds": 53.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Lying down helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.84,
      "end_seconds": 57.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Okay, is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.06,
      "end_seconds": 75.89,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "Blurred vision at times goes along with it, most of the time. And there's nosebleeds as well, you know, about three months now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.76,
      "end_seconds": 84.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "And what about ankle swelling, shortness of breath, passing less urine or weakness on one side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.91,
      "end_seconds": 89.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.43,
      "end_seconds": 92.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Any sign of slurred speech?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.92,
      "end_seconds": 95.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No slurred speech, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.74,
      "end_seconds": 100.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.14,
      "end_seconds": 104.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.17,
      "end_seconds": 109.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.04,
      "end_seconds": 112.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.57,
      "end_seconds": 133.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.91,
      "end_seconds": 141.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "my grandmother had dementia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.14,
      "end_seconds": 145.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.81,
      "end_seconds": 150.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "I mean, no, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.51,
      "end_seconds": 164.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.75,
      "end_seconds": 168.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.97,
      "end_seconds": 171.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.69,
      "end_seconds": 175.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.95,
      "end_seconds": 179.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.64,
      "end_seconds": 185.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.0,
      "end_seconds": 188.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.2,
      "end_seconds": 193.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.53,
      "end_seconds": 199.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.73,
      "end_seconds": 203.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.01,
      "end_seconds": 212.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.54,
      "end_seconds": 224.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.85,
      "end_seconds": 242.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "okay: BP is 163 over 102, temp 36.5 degrees, pulse 93."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.51,
      "end_seconds": 248.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.61,
      "end_seconds": 252.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.29,
      "end_seconds": 273.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "The back of your eyes looks fine and your heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.39,
      "end_seconds": 279.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "you can relax now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.9,
      "end_seconds": 309.55,
      "duration_seconds": 16.65,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be poorly controlled high blood pressure, or it might be a side effect of a medicine. I want a home blood pressure diary done, that's for hypertension."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 310.67,
      "end_seconds": 314.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I can book that for Wednesday at 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.08,
      "end_seconds": 324.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "The The treatment will be amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day, long term. It's for high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.17,
      "end_seconds": 326.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.62,
      "end_seconds": 360.27,
      "duration_seconds": 31.65,
      "text": "check your blood pressure at home twice a day for a week and bring the readings. Let's hold off on blood tests for now, and if there's no change in a month we can revisit it. If you get chest pain, weakness or trouble speaking, that's the point to come in urgently. We'll catch up in four weeks. Right, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.36,
      "end_seconds": 365.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.98,
      "end_seconds": 367.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}